{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">郭可盈與林文龍結婚多年一直恩愛如昔，兩人育有一女林天若，一家三口不時四處旅行歎世界，幸福美滿的生活令人稱羨。繼早前於布吉享受陽光與海灘後，最近一家人轉戰曼谷Chill遊度假，十分愜意。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">從郭可盈分享的照片中可見，一家人除了夜遊昭拍耶河（湄南河）體驗豪華晚宴外，亦前往一間高級酒店的知名黑膠主題酒吧朝聖。當天身穿粉色露肩短袖的郭可盈，甜蜜地依靠在老公林文龍身旁，兩人手挽手，甜度爆燈。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"a8e0f3bc-d413-421a-9640-1bd444f722a6.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/20267FUEID4G8W1786416167.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"a8e0f3bc-d413-421a-9640-1bd444f722a6.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"484f09c0-f84e-40a4-8127-4a8035e4d3ec.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026ltR3R9eXC61786416167.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"484f09c0-f84e-40a4-8127-4a8035e4d3ec.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"ce271ae6-d162-4532-9b00-a95f210ca827.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026BxqQHgVoeN1786416166.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"ce271ae6-d162-4532-9b00-a95f210ca827.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">此外，其中一張相片更見夫婦倆面貼面自拍，大方向網民放閃！不少網民看後，除了紛紛大讚一家三口擁有高顏值外，亦被夫妻二人的極佳狀態所驚艷，紛紛留言驚歎：「兩夫妻沒怎麼變」、「最有顏值和幸福的一家」。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-16T01:57:59.266237+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":289,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}